Scope of that material
----------------------

SRD-derived content in this project includes the six abilities and skill list,
the twelve core classes and their level 1-20 progressions, the core lineages,
backgrounds, spells, feats, magic items, armor and weapon statistics, and the
underlying rules mathematics (proficiency bonus, spell slot progressions,
hit points, armor class, saving throws, and attack calculations).

Content outside those documents — the ten expansion classes, their subclasses,
and the expansion lineages — are original implementations of archetypes in
common community use. All descriptive and flavor prose throughout this project
was written for it and is not reproduced from any publisher's books.


